  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>quinine</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>P01BC01</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Phillips RE et al. 1986</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>pregnant and lactating women with falciparum malaria</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>quinine</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_quinine/Quinine_Phillips1986_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>t,2,z</td><td>10</td><td>h</td><td><small>t1/2z</small></td></tr><tr><td>V (l kg)</td><td>10.1</td><td>L/kg</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>CL (ml min-' kg-')</td><td>0.80</td><td>mL/min/kg</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr></table><h4>About quinine</h4><p>Quinine is an antimalarial drug used to treat malaria, including falciparum malaria, and has also been used for babesiosis and muscle cramps. It remains an approved medicine, is listed among WHO essential medicines, and is used worldwide mainly for malaria, though it carries a boxed warning.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q189522\">Wikidata Q189522</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Quinine\">Quinine</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Phillips RE et al. (1986). Quinine pharmacokinetics and toxicity in pregnant and lactating women with falciparum malaria. <i>British journal of clinical pharmacology 21(6):677–683</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-2125.1986.tb05233.x\">10.1111/j.1365-2125.1986.tb05233.x</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/3527243\">3527243</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Phillips_1986: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
